rences extracted from visual databases (VisualGenome, ImageNet) used to train word embeddings in ViCo. It represents the co-occurrence between an object and its hypernym (a more general term).', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted from visual databases.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 1, 2]}, 'Object-Attribute': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'generic', 'method', 'generic'], 'description': ["A type of visual co-occurrence extracted from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations.", 'A type of visual co-occurrence extracted from visual databases, representing the relationship between objects and their attributes.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted, representing the relationship between objects and their attributes.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted from visual databases (VisualGenome, ImageNet) used to train word embeddings in ViCo. It represents the co-occurrence between an object and its attributes.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted from visual databases.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 0, 1, 1, 2]}, 'Attribute-Attribute': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'generic', 'method', 'generic'], 'description': ["A type of visual co-occurrence extracted from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations.", 'A type of visual co-occurrence extracted from visual databases, representing the relationships between different attributes of objects.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted, representing the relationship between attributes.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted from visual databases (VisualGenome, ImageNet) used to train word embeddings in ViCo. It represents the co-occurrence between different attributes.', 'One of the four types of visual co-occurrences extracted from visual databases.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 0, 1, 1, 2]}, 'Concept-Concept': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'generic', 'method', 'generic'], 'description': ["A 